{"seq":3,"slug":"layering-masking","title":"分层与遮罩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/playback-blending/layering-masking","wordCount":1360,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"分层与遮罩\">分层与遮罩</h1><p>角色边跑边换弹：下半身是奔跑循环，上半身是换弹动作，两者必须同时发生、互不干扰。<a href=\"state-machines\">动画状态机</a> 解决&quot;全身此刻播哪段&quot;，却答不了&quot;身体不同部位同时播不同段&quot;。分层（layering）与遮罩（masking）就是把姿态按骨骼集合切片、让多条动画各管一片再叠起来的机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分层系统把最终姿态看成多层叠加：底层（base layer）是全身基础动画，其上叠加若干层，每层带一个<strong>骨骼遮罩（mask）</strong> 指明它影响哪些骨骼、以及一个混合权重和混合模式。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Base Layer&lt;br/&gt;全身移动混合树] --&gt; M[逐骨合成最终姿态]&#10;  B[上半身层&lt;br/&gt;遮罩=脊柱+双臂+头] --&gt; M&#10;  C[加法层&lt;br/&gt;呼吸/受击抖动 全身弱权重] --&gt; M&#10;  D[面部层&lt;br/&gt;遮罩=面部骨/blendshape] --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt; O[输出姿态 交给 IK/物理]\">flowchart TD\n  A[Base Layer&lt;br/&gt;全身移动混合树] --&gt; M[逐骨合成最终姿态]\n  B[上半身层&lt;br/&gt;遮罩=脊柱+双臂+头] --&gt; M\n  C[加法层&lt;br/&gt;呼吸/受击抖动 全身弱权重] --&gt; M\n  D[面部层&lt;br/&gt;遮罩=面部骨/blendshape] --&gt; M\n  M --&gt; O[输出姿态 交给 IK/物理]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>层 (layer)</td>\n<td>一条带遮罩与权重的动画流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遮罩 (mask)</td>\n<td>指定该层作用于哪些骨骼（含/不含子层级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖混合 (override)</td>\n<td>在遮罩骨上用本层姿态替换下层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加法混合 (additive)</td>\n<td>在遮罩骨上把差异姿态叠加到下层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层权重</td>\n<td>0~1，控制本层整体强度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"骨骼遮罩\">骨骼遮罩</h2><p>遮罩是一个布尔（或权重）向量，长度等于骨骼数，标注每根骨是否受本层影响。换弹层的遮罩通常包含脊柱上段、双臂、头、手指，而排除骨盆与双腿——于是下半身始终由底层奔跑驱动。遮罩还可带<strong>权重渐变</strong>：在脊柱根部给 0.3、向上递增到双臂的 1.0，让上下半身在腰部平滑过渡，避免出现&quot;上下两截硬接&quot;的折断感。</p>\n<p>遮罩定义在骨骼层级上，所以&quot;包含某骨及其所有子骨&quot;是常见快捷选项（选中肩骨即自动含整条手臂）。这把遮罩与第一章的骨架树结构直接绑定——遮罩的本质就是骨架树上的一个子集选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖混合与加法混合\">覆盖混合与加法混合</h2><p>两种混合模式在遮罩骨上的语义截然不同。<strong>覆盖混合</strong>按层权重在下层姿态与本层姿态之间插值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>lower</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>layer</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>mask</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{out}}(b) = (1 - w)\\,P_{\\text{lower}}(b) + w\\,P_{\\text{layer}}(b), \\quad b \\in \\text{mask}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lower</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">layer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mask</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>换弹这种&quot;完全接管上半身&quot;的动作用覆盖。<strong>加法混合</strong>则把本层视为相对某参考姿态的<strong>差异</strong>，叠加到下层：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>out</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>lower</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊕</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>layer</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊖</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{out}}(b) = P_{\\text{lower}}(b) \\oplus w \\cdot \\Delta(b), \\quad \\Delta(b) = P_{\\text{layer}}(b) \\ominus P_{\\text{ref}}(b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">out</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lower</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">layer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ref</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊕</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>⊖</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oplus / \\ominus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\">⊖</span></span></span></span></span> 对旋转是四元数乘法/求逆相乘。呼吸起伏、受击抖动、瞄准偏移都用加法——它们是&quot;在任何底层动画之上再叠一点扰动&quot;，不关心底层具体是什么。加法层的差异姿态制作要点：导出时减去参考姿态（常是动画首帧或专门的中立姿态），否则叠加会带来整体偏移。这与 <a href=\"blend-trees\">混合空间与混合树</a> 末尾提到的瞄准偏移是同一套机制。</p>\n<p>两种模式的根本差异在于&quot;结果落在哪里&quot;。覆盖混合的结果必然落在下层与本层姿态之间（权重 1 时完全是本层），是一种<strong>替换</strong>；加法混合的结果可能落在两者之外，因为它叠的是相对量，权重 1 时是&quot;下层 + 完整差异&quot;，是一种<strong>累积</strong>。这决定了它们的可叠加性：多个加法层可以无脑相继叠加（差异相加满足结合律），而多个覆盖层相继作用时，靠后的层会抹掉靠前层在重叠遮罩骨上的结果，顺序敏感。理解这一点，才能正确安排下文那个分层栈的求值次序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"典型分层架构\">典型分层架构</h2><p>一个射击游戏角色的分层往往是这样的栈：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>遮罩</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Base</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>全身</td>\n<td>移动混合树（站/走/跑/蹲）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上半身动作</td>\n<td>覆盖</td>\n<td>脊柱上+双臂+手</td>\n<td>换弹/开镜/投掷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瞄准偏移</td>\n<td>加法</td>\n<td>脊柱+双臂</td>\n<td>上半身朝瞄准方向偏转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>受击反应</td>\n<td>加法</td>\n<td>全身弱权重</td>\n<td>中弹抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>面部</td>\n<td>覆盖</td>\n<td>面部骨</td>\n<td>表情/口型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>层的顺序（求值次序）有意义：加法层通常放在覆盖层之后，让抖动叠在最终造型上而非被覆盖层抹掉。面部层几乎总在最顶，且其口型与表情有专门的驱动方式，详见 <a href=\"../advanced-runtime/facial-lipsync\">面部动画与口型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与后续阶段的衔接\">与后续阶段的衔接</h2><p>分层产出的是一个&quot;已经组织好&quot;的全身姿态，但它仍可能与环境对不上：上半身覆盖层让手摆到了某个位置，却未必正好握住武器；下半身在斜坡上仍是平地走的姿态。这些末端对位与贴地修正不属于分层，而由 <a href=\"../procedural-ik/inverse-kinematics\">反向动力学 IK</a> 在分层之后处理。换句话说，分层是混合阶段的最后一步，IK 是它和物理之间的桥。求值顺序通常是：状态机 → 混合树 → 分层 → IK → 物理 → 上屏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分层把最终姿态拆成多层带遮罩的动画叠加，实现身体不同部位同时做不同事。</li>\n<li>遮罩是骨架树上的子集选择，可带权重渐变以平滑过渡区。</li>\n<li>覆盖混合在遮罩骨上替换下层，加法混合叠加差异姿态（呼吸/受击/瞄准）。</li>\n<li>加法差异须减去参考姿态，否则引入整体偏移。</li>\n<li>分层是混合阶段终点，其后接 IK 与物理；面部层另有专门驱动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分层与遮罩","id":"分层与遮罩"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"骨骼遮罩","id":"骨骼遮罩"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖混合与加法混合","id":"覆盖混合与加法混合"},{"level":2,"text":"典型分层架构","id":"典型分层架构"},{"level":2,"text":"与后续阶段的衔接","id":"与后续阶段的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"动画状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/playback-blending/state-machines"},"next":{"title":"反向动力学 IK","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-animation-systems/procedural-ik/inverse-kinematics"}}